# Paper

This folder contains the LaTeX manuscript scaffold for `{{ project_name }}`.

## Build

Install Tectonic (`brew install tectonic` on macOS), then run:

```bash
make paper
```

From this folder, you can also run:

```bash
make pdf
make watch
make clean
```

The root `make paper` target delegates to `paper/Makefile` and writes
`paper/main.pdf`.

`make watch` updates `build/main.pdf`; view that file while editing.
Run `make pdf` to refresh the copy at `main.pdf`.
